{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"90ab0208c5377a3c","type":"group","x":-550,"y":-2415,"width":1000,"height":4830,"color":"2","label":"<HTML />"},
		{"id":"c45a4fa0be901dbd","type":"group","x":-510,"y":95,"width":920,"height":1380,"color":"2","label":"Module Scripts Run"},
		{"id":"03ca6a19e67c8947","type":"group","x":-510,"y":-654,"width":920,"height":618,"color":"2","label":"Classic Inline Scripts Run"},
		{"id":"f5a28aa8bba154c9","type":"group","x":-510,"y":-1982,"width":920,"height":480,"color":"2","label":"<HEAD />"},
		{"id":"5cc86ad286725d6a","type":"group","x":-510,"y":-1307,"width":920,"height":210,"color":"2","label":"<BODY />"},
		{"id":"0eb6bfb7c3cb8ffb","type":"text","text":"📍HTML parsing begins — `index.html` response streams; head assets are discovered by the preload scanner in document order","x":-250,"y":-2350,"width":400,"height":90,"color":"#5e99d9"},
		{"id":"4aac9a30dc093f44","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/views/templates/partials/head/head-load-sequence.canvas","x":-490,"y":-1937,"width":880,"height":400},
		{"id":"755c20ccd4f72c02","type":"text","text":"📍body parse — Sanity `poster=` images + `<img data-card-el=\"image\">` (no `loading=lazy`) fetch eagerly; award logos `loading=\"lazy\"` wait for viewport proximity","x":-250,"y":-1457,"width":400,"height":105,"color":"#5e99d9"},
		{"id":"9e41381fe38eebda","type":"text","text":"📍`<video data-defer-video data-src>` — **no fetch**: `src` is absent during parse, so no media request on the critical path","x":-250,"y":-1257,"width":400,"height":85,"color":"#5e99d9"},
		{"id":"4fa49ba22c157705","type":"text","text":"📍HTML parsing complete","x":-250,"y":-1037,"width":400,"height":65,"color":"#5e99d9"},
		{"id":"b44bca28e2738375","type":"text","text":"## 📢    readystatechange = interactive\n`readystatechange`. Parser done, DOM complete. Module scripts run in document order.","x":-510,"y":-917,"width":920,"height":135,"color":"#5e99d9"},
		{"id":"7998ed25febac019","type":"text","text":"## readystate = loading","x":-510,"y":-2185,"width":920,"height":93,"color":"#5e99d9"},
		{"id":"1ed7447595e06227","type":"text","text":"### What is the impact of this?\nDoesn't TailwindCSS render the fold moot?","x":-1050,"y":-1677,"width":420,"height":100},
		{"id":"3c05cad0cc0e47a7","type":"text","text":"#7 · Deprioritize below-fold media (S)\nCard `<img>`s (e.g. 3942×2958 PNG) and card posters fetch eagerly at parse, competing with DraftPaper, the bundle and the hero mp4. `loading=lazy decoding=async` on card images, `fetchpriority=low` on card posters, `fetchpriority=high` on the hero poster.","x":-1050,"y":-1517,"width":420,"height":226,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"863a1be085277417","type":"text","text":"Do fonts still block render?","x":590,"y":-1937,"width":400,"height":72,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"9a48015ad6214194","type":"text","text":"### 📍 FCP\nFirst contentful paint: paint-timing entry, not a lifecycle state. Not ordered against `interactive`: the first frame renders once CSSOM + DOM allow; on home the parse (~50–110ms) usually finishes first. CSS intro starts here.","x":590,"y":-1126,"width":400,"height":243,"color":"#5e99d9"},
		{"id":"d5e9c574ec8ca27d","type":"text","text":"###  Begin measuring FCP","x":590,"y":-2343,"width":400,"height":76,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"bc8df7ddbfc043f2","type":"text","text":"## document.fonts.ready","x":590,"y":-1567,"width":400,"height":50,"color":"#5e99d9"},
		{"id":"266025d7a2222754","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/views/templates/partials/session-management-script/session-management-script.md","subpath":"#^e36dca","x":-250,"y":-595,"width":400,"height":90,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"91d41ca8c4e97e03","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/views/templates/partials/session-management-script/session-management-script.md","subpath":"#^204f8f","x":-10,"y":-306,"width":400,"height":181,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"d9328ee059f77571","type":"text","text":"## Q: How does the preload strategy handle first visits?\nThe design intent is for the page to deliver the full experience for the visitor, starting with the preloader intro animation, continuing through the cyclical idle animation, and completing with the outro animation.","x":-490,"y":-306,"width":400,"height":232,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"8f6cb07e134f3bea","type":"text","text":"💡 Classic inline scripts located at the end of the body run automatically when readystate transitions to \"interactive\".","x":-1050,"y":-648,"width":420,"height":87,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"24d17782b18b8f9b","type":"text","text":"💡 Modules are implicitly deferred — fetch starts at head parse, execution waits until whole document parsed - including any classic inline scripts triggered when the HTML parser encounters them.","x":-1050,"y":100,"width":420,"height":136,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"5c82fec409abf17e","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/views/pages/home/home.md","subpath":"#^d4166b","x":-250,"y":898,"width":400,"height":112,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"b330711831cc0c3c","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/views/pages/home/home.md","subpath":"#^60f6f2","x":-250,"y":1087,"width":400,"height":142,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"4872ca409fa3b563","type":"text","text":"📍bundle evaluated — GSAP plugins registered (no `window.gsap`); `scheduleInit()` → `requestIdleCallback(initDirector, {timeout: 150})`","x":-250,"y":1286,"width":400,"height":145,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"7248d82dbe8d051d","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/views/pages/home/home.md","subpath":"#^ecb8b3","x":-250,"y":171,"width":400,"height":130,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"4982ae41d68b7270","type":"text","text":"📍Preloader.js module evaluated","x":-250,"y":377,"width":400,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"34324c59d756ed42","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/views/pages/home/home.md","subpath":"#^3c1561","x":-250,"y":500,"width":400,"height":90,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"56545861974d53f5","type":"text","text":"📍body-end module runs — `import(bundle.js)` *started*","x":-250,"y":643,"width":400,"height":80,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"fa41100f71ce4d56","type":"text","text":"## Q: Does the preloader really get hidden before paint? After? ","x":590,"y":-386,"width":400,"height":80,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"d8fbf52fbc1453db","type":"text","text":"### Defect — hide never fires\n`head.njk` runs this script before `<body>` is parsed, so `document.querySelector(\"[data-preloader]\")` is `null` (rendered `_site/index.html`: script precedes the element). Return visits still play the full outro. The script's own comment (\"right after the landing header\") is stale.","x":590,"y":-231,"width":400,"height":331,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"41686f08816e2c93","type":"text","text":"## 📢 DOMContentLoaded (event)\nFires as soon as the head/body module scripts have run — the bundle is still in flight (its fetch starts at the same ms as DCL, measured). Bundle evaluates after; `scheduleInit` sees `readyState !== \"loading\"` and calls `requestIdleCallback(initDirector, {timeout: 150})` directly.","x":630,"y":689,"width":420,"height":265,"color":"#5e99d9"},
		{"id":"b96a3f31d77dacf8","type":"text","text":"## 📢 readystatechange = complete\n`readystatechange`. complete → `load` (event)\n\nAll subresources done (Sanity images, sizzle poster/video). Measured 166–317ms on home — typically *before* Director boot finishes; nothing in the preloader waits on it.\n\nDeferred videos are **not** counted — they have no `src` yet.","x":-510,"y":1697,"width":920,"height":215,"color":"#5e99d9"}
	],
